# FEEL-4: LB + RB is F1 however the pair is pressed inside the 60 ms window: together, one or the
# other first, 59 ms apart, and let go in either order or held long. No chord leaves a stray Q or E
# (their single-button keys) behind. The rest-of-the-window cases are in combo-window-edges.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Combos
press lb
press rb
advance 80
release lb rb
advance 200
press rb
advance 30
press lb
advance 80
release lb
advance 20
release rb
advance 200
press lb
advance 59
press rb
advance 1500
release rb
advance 20
release lb
advance 200
---
key KEY_F1 down @0
key KEY_F1 up   @80
key KEY_F1 down @310
key KEY_F1 up   @390
key KEY_F1 down @669
key KEY_F1 up   @2169
